      "side": 1,
      "message": "Using shmem_file() and shmem_getpage() doesn\u0027t work when the Trusty driver is a module, since these symbols aren\u0027t exported.\n\nI wonder if using a shmem file descriptor is the wrong approach.  It\u0027s only used to get some pages.\n\nDid you consider using a user virtual address and get_user_pages() instead?  I think that would be more similar to other kernel APIs.",
