      "writtenOn": "2020-09-24T00:02:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is for symmetry with the next tier of the feature, which will support operating on Ion buffers which cannot necessarily be mapped into Linux. It\u0027d be weird if one form of memory used a file descriptor and the other didn\u0027t.",
